00:00:13.850 --> 00:00:15.690
Are we all here?

00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:19.480
Why did you have us gather before practice?

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:21.980
Be calm and just listen.

00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:28.190
Our debut concert is set!

00:00:31.150 --> 00:00:33.190
What? Huh?

00:00:33.190 --> 00:00:35.810
They don't seem too excited.

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:37.150
Debut...

00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:39.150
Our...

00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:40.810
Kotono...

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:43.900
When is it?

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:17.690
The debut concert will be held
on the special stage

00:02:17.690 --> 00:02:20.440
at the Hoshimi Festival,
one of Hoshimi City's biggest events.

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:22.980
That's where Mana had her debut concert.

00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:22.580
Hoshimi
Festival

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:22.700
Hoshimi
Festival

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:22.830
Hoshimi
Festival

00:02:22.980 --> 00:02:24.060
Yes.

00:02:23.450 --> 00:02:23.580
Hoshimi
