00:02:26.310 --> 00:02:29.770
I'll give you the debut song recording
and choreography video.

00:02:29.770 --> 00:02:33.730
We'll have you start real lessons with a
professional coach at a studio in the city.

00:02:33.730 --> 00:02:37.600
Make sure you familiarize yourself
with the song and dance until then.

00:02:39.190 --> 00:02:42.600
This is the legendary studio
that fostered Miss Mana!

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:44.650
"Legendary" is an exaggeration.

00:02:44.650 --> 00:02:47.650
But it's a famous studio where

00:02:47.650 --> 00:02:50.190
LizNoir and TRINITYAiLE take lessons, too.

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:54.100
We were able to focus on
basic training until now,

00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:58.190
but from here on out,
you'll be busier than ever.

00:02:58.190 --> 00:03:01.900
And we'll also enter the Venus Program.

00:03:01.900 --> 00:03:03.850
The Venus Program...

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:07.980
An idol ranking system based on AI judgments.

00:03:07.980 --> 00:03:09.440
That's right.

00:03:09.440 --> 00:03:13.230
Once you make a debut,
experience and career make no difference.

00:03:13.230 --> 00:03:15.100
Do you think you're ready?

00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:16.400
Yes!

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:19.770
Let's go, everyone.

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:24.940
I'm Nomoto and I'll be
training you all starting today.

00:03:24.940 --> 00:03:25.940
Nice to meet you!

00:03:25.940 --> 00:03:28.190
Thank you very much!

00:03:28.190 --> 00:03:30.060
Are you Mana's younger sister?

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:31.400
Yes.

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:32.850
I see...

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:34.980
Good luck.

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:36.850
Yes!

00:03:36.850 --> 00:03:40.480
All right! Now, let's start out
with stretches, shall we?

00:03:40.480 --> 00:03:42.400
What? Already?

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:43.940
Come on!

00:03:43.940 --> 00:03:46.520
Don't waste the limited time we have.

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:47.350
Yes!

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:52.350
Now,

00:03:52.350 --> 00:03:54.850
let's get started with the interview.

00:03:54.850 --> 00:03:56.310
Y-Yes!

00:03:56.310 --> 00:03:58.900
Th-Thank you vewy mu-- Oh!

00:03:58.900 --> 00:03:59.850
Very much!

00:03:59.850 --> 00:04:02.650
Try to relax, everyone.

00:04:02.650 --> 00:04:04.850
I love their fresh energy.

00:04:04.850 --> 00:04:08.600
But Miss Haruko Saeki, I heard you are
the experienced one of the group.

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:09.650
Yes.

00:04:09.650 --> 00:04:12.190
I used to be a solo artist.

00:04:12.190 --> 00:04:15.190
With the formation of the group,
I'm turning over a new leaf.

00:04:15.190 --> 00:04:19.600
I'll be working hard as if I'm a newcomer again,
so I'd love everyone's support!

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:20.690
So eloquent.

00:04:20.690 --> 00:04:22.270
Haruko, that was impressive!

00:04:22.270 --> 00:04:24.190
Truly.

00:04:28.020 --> 00:04:30.520
Hey! How did your dance lesson go?

00:04:30.520 --> 00:04:33.060
What was your coach like?

00:04:33.060 --> 00:04:35.560
Suzu is trembling with fear...

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:38.350
What? She's that scary?

00:04:38.350 --> 00:04:41.520
It is no wonder that she trained Miss Mana.

00:04:41.520 --> 00:04:44.020
There's no need to worry.

00:04:44.020 --> 00:04:47.400
She may be strict, but she's very thorough.

00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:51.730
The coach needs to be strict--
so we can catch up to Miss Mana.

00:04:51.730 --> 00:04:53.190
Plus...

00:04:53.190 --> 00:04:54.440
It's a lot of fun.

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:55.980
Huh?

00:04:55.980 --> 00:04:59.480
I get to really see how much we've progressed.

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:01.600
What is it?

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:03.560
Oh, no, um...

00:05:03.560 --> 00:05:07.520
We all got surprised when the words "it's fun"
came out of your mouth, Kotono.

00:05:07.520 --> 00:05:09.940
I didn't think I said anything weird...

00:05:09.940 --> 00:05:11.150
That's great.

00:05:11.150 --> 00:05:13.230
I can't wait to take our lessons!

00:05:13.230 --> 00:05:15.650
How did the interview go with you all?

00:05:15.650 --> 00:05:18.310
I got nervous and fumbled a lot.

00:05:18.310 --> 00:05:21.770
I don't remember... what I said...

00:05:21.770 --> 00:05:23.020
How about you, Rei?

00:05:23.020 --> 00:05:25.940
Did you speak well?

00:05:25.940 --> 00:05:28.560
I'm not sure if I spoke well,

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:31.400
but I've done interviews
at dance competitions, too.

00:05:31.400 --> 00:05:34.270
So, much like dancing, it's all about
practice and getting used to it.

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:36.810
We'll be appearing on the radio
to promote our concerts,

00:05:36.810 --> 00:05:39.520
so now would be the time to practice.

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:41.100
Yeah.

00:05:41.100 --> 00:05:42.560
Radio appearances...

00:05:42.560 --> 00:05:43.480
Miss Kotono!

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:45.520
Share with us your enthusiasm
about the debut concert!

00:05:45.520 --> 00:05:47.060
What? Um...

00:05:47.060 --> 00:05:48.190
I won't lose.

00:05:48.190 --> 00:05:49.520
Against who exactly?

00:05:49.520 --> 00:05:52.600
Kotono, let's practice together later.

00:05:52.600 --> 00:05:54.770
Now we're training with a coach...

00:05:54.770 --> 00:05:56.440
Taking interviews...

00:05:56.440 --> 00:05:59.100
We're really going to have our debut!

00:05:59.100 --> 00:06:01.690
Let's pull off our debut concert no matter what!

00:06:01.690 --> 00:06:02.770
Yeah.

00:06:02.770 --> 00:06:03.940
Of course.

00:06:03.940 --> 00:06:06.520
Making our debut is only the first step.

00:06:06.520 --> 00:06:08.310
What we aim for is beyond that.

00:06:08.310 --> 00:06:09.900
To reach the top as idols.

00:06:09.900 --> 00:06:12.520
Let's climb to the top, just like Miss Mana!

00:06:12.520 --> 00:06:15.400
Hey! Let's do our chant
we made up together yesterday!

00:06:15.400 --> 00:06:16.400
Good idea!

00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:17.900
Let's do it!

00:06:17.900 --> 00:06:19.850
What? Now...?

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:22.020
Come on, Kotono!

00:06:24.020 --> 00:06:25.440
Okay.

00:06:29.810 --> 00:06:31.730
Everyone ready?

00:06:31.730 --> 00:06:33.190
Yup.

00:06:33.190 --> 00:06:34.980
Hoshimi Productions!

00:06:34.980 --> 00:06:35.870
Let's!

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:36.230
Go!

00:06:36.230 --> 00:06:37.040
Fight!

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:37.520
Yeah!

00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:39.060
Go, go, go, go!

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:41.270
Yeah!

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:25.230
Hoshimi Productions

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:25.230
Hoshimi Productions

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:25.230
Hoshimi Productions

00:08:58.690 --> 00:09:01.230
The victor of today's concert battle is...

00:09:01.230 --> 00:09:04.310
...TRINITYAiLE!

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:08.940
Thank you very much!

00:09:16.060 --> 00:09:17.560
Congratulations!

00:09:17.560 --> 00:09:20.190
You had yet another
unparalleled performance today!

00:09:20.190 --> 00:09:22.020
Thank you very much.

00:09:22.020 --> 00:09:26.400
It seems like you've got the momentum to surpass
Miss Mana's record-length winning streak.

00:09:26.400 --> 00:09:29.600
You're headed to become untouchable,

00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:32.100
but is there an idol out there
you'd like to challenge?

00:09:32.100 --> 00:09:33.980
Not particularly.

00:09:33.980 --> 00:09:38.190
But I've got the confidence to beat any idol.

00:09:38.190 --> 00:09:40.810
What I've been aiming for with
this group since the beginning

00:09:40.810 --> 00:09:42.730
is to get to the top as idols.

00:09:43.730 --> 00:09:46.940
Hey, everyone! Thank you all
for all your support today.

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:48.900
We look forward to your support again!

00:09:51.150 --> 00:09:53.230
Rui, you were so cool today!

00:09:53.230 --> 00:09:55.690
You come off strong as usual, though.

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:57.900
I'm only speaking the truth.

00:09:59.190 --> 00:10:01.770
We'll fly even higher.

00:10:01.770 --> 00:10:03.100
Isn't that right?

00:10:04.190 --> 00:10:06.060
Mr. Asakura?

00:10:06.060 --> 00:10:07.150
Yeah.

00:10:07.150 --> 00:10:09.520
I've heard about the debut.

00:10:09.520 --> 00:10:12.690
I don't plan on sending any flowers, though.

00:10:12.690 --> 00:10:15.730
We'll be facing each other soon.

00:10:15.730 --> 00:10:18.020
But don't be too hard on us.

00:10:18.020 --> 00:10:20.190
Don't disappoint me.

00:10:20.190 --> 00:10:22.020
Hello, President!

00:10:22.020 --> 00:10:24.560
Is someone going to make their debut?

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:26.980
For the first time in four years
from Hoshimi Productions.

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:28.940
Hoshimi Productions...

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:31.730
If their abilities are real,

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:35.060
you'll be fighting against
them, too, eventually.

00:10:35.060 --> 00:10:37.060
Brace yourselves.

00:10:38.150 --> 00:10:40.350
Is that all you have to say?

00:10:40.350 --> 00:10:42.900
You watched our performance, didn't you?

00:10:42.900 --> 00:10:44.850
We might break Mana Nagase's
undefeated record--

00:10:44.850 --> 00:10:46.480
So what?

00:10:47.440 --> 00:10:49.940
You won't be able to catch up to Mana Nagase

00:10:49.940 --> 00:10:51.940
when you're preoccupied with stupid things.

00:10:51.940 --> 00:10:53.440
Remember that.

00:10:56.350 --> 00:10:57.690
Rui...

00:11:02.900 --> 00:11:04.440
Tomorrow is finally

00:11:04.440 --> 00:11:06.350
our debut concert!

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:09.440
It will be held at the special stage
at the Hoshimi Festival.

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:11.650
We hope to see you all there!

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:13.060
Boom!

00:11:17.850 --> 00:11:19.100
Nagisa?

00:11:21.440 --> 00:11:22.600
Are you okay?

00:11:22.600 --> 00:11:24.270
Sorry about that.

00:11:24.270 --> 00:11:26.980
When I think about tomorrow,

00:11:26.980 --> 00:11:28.770
my mind goes all over the place.

00:11:28.770 --> 00:11:31.100
What was on your mind?

00:11:31.100 --> 00:11:33.520
Like, "Will I be able to sing well?"

00:11:33.520 --> 00:11:36.600
"Will I mess up the choreography?"

00:11:36.600 --> 00:11:40.100
I'm scared that I'll hold everyone back.

00:11:40.100 --> 00:11:42.100
I'm very nervous.

00:11:43.480 --> 00:11:45.690
Why don't we serve the nice black tea today?

00:11:45.690 --> 00:11:48.400
So we can all relax.

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:50.150
Thank you very much.

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:53.020
"Night Checklist"
"Help prepare dinner"
"Eat dinner"

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:53.020
"Review choreography and song"

00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:55.150
Saki!

00:11:55.150 --> 00:11:56.730
The bath is ready!

00:11:56.730 --> 00:11:57.940
Okay!

00:11:57.940 --> 00:11:59.350
What is that?

00:11:59.350 --> 00:12:03.060
I was putting together a list of things
I need to do before the concert.

00:12:03.060 --> 00:12:05.440
What? That's amazing!

00:12:05.440 --> 00:12:08.810
I want to make sure things go as usual,
especially on important days.

00:12:08.810 --> 00:12:10.190
So I can tell myself:

00:12:10.190 --> 00:12:14.810
"You're prepared. You've done
everything you can do right now."

00:12:17.060 --> 00:12:18.770
Chisa, Shizuku.

00:12:18.770 --> 00:12:21.900
If you overdo it right now,
it'll affect you tomorrow.

00:12:21.900 --> 00:12:23.270
Just a little more.

00:12:23.270 --> 00:12:25.650
Please watch us one more time.

00:12:27.310 --> 00:12:30.270
Be ready for a thorough
stretch session after this.

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:31.600
Yes!

00:12:39.060 --> 00:12:40.560
Tomorrow...

00:12:46.060 --> 00:12:47.560
Kotono.

00:12:49.600 --> 00:12:51.020
Sakura.

00:12:55.230 --> 00:12:56.690
Tomorrow's the day.

00:12:56.690 --> 00:12:57.560
Yup.

00:12:57.560 --> 00:12:59.310
Are you nervous?

00:12:59.310 --> 00:13:01.060
Are you, Sakura?

00:13:03.520 --> 00:13:05.520
My heart is pounding.

00:13:07.190 --> 00:13:10.310
I wonder if I am...

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:13.520
I've been so eager to have our debut.

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:15.850
So thinking that it's tomorrow feels strange.

00:13:15.850 --> 00:13:18.400
I can't stay calm.

00:13:18.400 --> 00:13:21.940
When we make our debut,
we enter the Venus Program, right?

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:24.100
Then we'll become rivals.

00:13:24.100 --> 00:13:25.190
What?

00:13:25.190 --> 00:13:27.480
There's only one spot at the top.

00:13:27.480 --> 00:13:29.270
As we advance higher,

00:13:29.270 --> 00:13:32.980
we'll eventually sing on the same stage.

00:13:32.980 --> 00:13:34.190
When that time comes,

00:13:34.190 --> 00:13:35.810
I won't lose!

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:37.440
Kotono...

00:13:38.770 --> 00:13:40.230
Oh, sorry.

00:13:40.230 --> 00:13:42.060
I'm going back inside.

00:13:45.100 --> 00:13:46.440
Kotono!

00:13:48.400 --> 00:13:50.270
I'll do my best, too.

00:13:50.270 --> 00:13:53.810
For us to stand on the same stage.

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:55.440
I won't lose, either.

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:58.270
Yeah.

00:14:04.560 --> 00:14:07.100
Rivals, huh?

00:14:11.020 --> 00:14:12.810
<i>Idoly Pride.</i>

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:17.370
"Grill"     " <i>Okonomiyaki</i> "    "Beer"

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:19.210
"Hoshimi Festival"

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:22.230
"Special Stage"

00:14:19.690 --> 00:14:22.230
It takes me back to the day I made my debut.

00:14:22.230 --> 00:14:26.310
That was the only day you were
ever obviously nervous.

00:14:26.310 --> 00:14:28.150
What? I was not.

00:14:28.150 --> 00:14:29.850
I'm a genius, remember?

00:14:29.850 --> 00:14:31.560
You were.

00:14:31.560 --> 00:14:33.310
You put on your costume wrong,

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:36.400
and paced back and forth in front of the mirror.

00:14:36.400 --> 00:14:40.100
And to top it all off, you said you didn't
want to perform at the last minute.

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:42.020
Did I really say that?

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:44.560
You forget things when it's convenient for you.

00:14:44.560 --> 00:14:45.980
That's not true.

00:14:45.980 --> 00:14:47.850
You're remembering things wrong.

00:14:47.850 --> 00:14:49.400
Are you sure?

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:50.980
Well, it doesn't matter either way.

00:14:50.980 --> 00:14:52.270
That's right!

00:14:53.310 --> 00:14:54.440
But...

00:14:54.440 --> 00:14:59.600
I still clearly remember the very
moment you stood on stage.

00:14:59.600 --> 00:15:03.650
I ran around every day to get things
ready and help with lessons...

00:15:03.650 --> 00:15:05.600
We thought of different ideas together.

00:15:05.600 --> 00:15:08.310
We even fought at times, too.

00:15:08.310 --> 00:15:12.060
But the stress blew away all at once.

00:15:13.060 --> 00:15:16.600
I want to witness that same moment again.

00:15:17.940 --> 00:15:21.400
That may be why I still continue to do this job.

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:27.020
It's almost time.

00:15:40.060 --> 00:15:42.020
It's okay.

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:44.940
I'm sure it'll go great.

00:15:44.940 --> 00:15:46.270
Here we go!

00:15:46.270 --> 00:15:48.810
Sunny Peace!

