♬ It's strange ♬

00:16:22.730 --> 00:16:25.310
♬ It looks brighter today ♬

00:16:25.310 --> 00:16:29.650
♬ I won't forget the tears from that day ♬

00:16:29.650 --> 00:16:31.190
♬ That's a promise ♬

00:16:31.190 --> 00:16:32.060
♬ Impatience ♬

00:16:32.060 --> 00:16:33.980
♬ Dreams and excitement ♬

00:16:33.980 --> 00:16:36.400
♬ I don't want to regret anything ♬

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:40.350
♬ If I do ever get lost ♬

00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:42.480
♬ The important things ♬

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:47.400
♬ The beating of my heart lets me know ♬

00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:51.520
♬ These feelings in my heart ♬

