♬ If I can face them ♬

00:16:53.770 --> 00:16:54.990
♬ I can ♬

00:16:54.990 --> 00:16:56.350
♬ Establish myself ♬

00:16:56.350 --> 00:16:57.320
♬ Become ♬

00:16:57.320 --> 00:16:57.690
♬ Even ♬

00:16:57.690 --> 00:17:01.270
♬ Stronger ♬

00:17:02.150 --> 00:17:04.540
♬ This feeling in our hearts ♬

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:05.060
♬ Together ♬

00:17:05.060 --> 00:17:06.980
♬ Let's shine ♬

00:17:06.980 --> 00:17:08.190
♬ Brightly! ♬

00:17:08.190 --> 00:17:11.980
♬ I want to illuminate you brightly! ♬

00:17:11.980 --> 00:17:13.650
♬ Sunny P! ♬

00:17:13.650 --> 00:17:14.840
♬ Hold me tight right now ♬

00:17:14.840 --> 00:17:16.440
♬ What should I do? ♬

00:17:16.440 --> 00:17:19.400
♬ The beating doesn't stop ♬

00:17:19.400 --> 00:17:23.400
♬ Five peace signs together ♬

00:17:23.400 --> 00:17:27.600
♬ Become a star ♬

00:17:27.600 --> 00:17:32.770
♬ I want to shine all the time ♬

00:18:01.400 --> 00:18:03.310
Let's do this.

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:05.270
Moon Tempest!

00:18:29.270 --> 00:18:34.600
♬ A single flower blooms at night ♬

00:18:34.600 --> 00:18:39.940
♬ A precious and beautiful sight ♬

00:18:39.940 --> 00:18:44.310
♬ Why am I shedding tears? ♬

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:49.310
♬ Everything is out of focus in front of me ♬

00:18:49.310 --> 00:18:52.060
♬ I breathed hard ♬

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:54.730
♬ I looked straight ahead ♬

00:18:54.730 --> 00:19:00.020
♬ But I was still trembling a little ♬

00:19:00.020 --> 00:19:02.810
♬ In the true darkness ♬

00:19:02.810 --> 00:19:06.100
♬ I couldn't see anything ♬

00:19:06.100 --> 00:19:10.730
♬ But I found out what it means "to shine" ♬

00:19:10.730 --> 00:19:14.060
♬ The moonlight shines on your light ♬

00:19:14.060 --> 00:19:16.600
♬ The first time I felt this true wish ♬

00:19:16.600 --> 00:19:18.520
♬ It's so bright and brings happiness ♬

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:21.480
♬ Everything starts to change ♬

00:19:21.480 --> 00:19:24.520
♬ The waxing and waning shakes
the darkness in my heart ♬

00:19:24.520 --> 00:19:27.190
♬ I'll accept it and won't hesitate anymore ♬

00:19:27.190 --> 00:19:31.480
♬ I'll do as much as I want to in this moment ♬

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:34.100
♬ It's so uncertain ♬

00:19:34.100 --> 00:19:36.690
♬ I could crumble at any moment ♬

00:19:36.690 --> 00:19:39.270
♬ But you illuminate me ♬

00:19:39.270 --> 00:19:41.980
♬ So I'm able to shine ♬

00:20:33.400 --> 00:20:36.190
Hello, everyone!

00:20:36.190 --> 00:20:38.020
We're Sunny Peace!

00:20:38.020 --> 00:20:39.980
We're Moon Tempest.

00:20:39.980 --> 00:20:43.940
We made our joint debut today!

00:20:43.940 --> 00:20:47.650
We're newcomers so we're inexperienced,

00:20:47.650 --> 00:20:49.980
but we will all work hard,

00:20:49.980 --> 00:20:53.770
and motivate each other to continue to grow.

00:20:56.270 --> 00:21:01.230
And, we'll work hard to aim
for the top as idols.

00:21:01.230 --> 00:21:02.980
Good luck!

00:21:02.980 --> 00:21:05.150
I'll be rooting for you!

00:21:06.400 --> 00:21:08.190
Th-Thank you very much!

00:21:08.190 --> 00:21:09.850
Suzu Narumiya here!

00:21:09.850 --> 00:21:12.900
I, Suzu Narumiya of Hoshimi City's
prided Hoshimi Productions,

00:21:12.900 --> 00:21:14.810
look forward to your support!

00:21:14.810 --> 00:21:17.560
Suzu, this isn't an election, you know?

00:21:17.560 --> 00:21:20.730
Should I do my usual greeting, too?

00:21:20.730 --> 00:21:23.230
I suggest you don't...

00:21:23.230 --> 00:21:24.650
Sunny P and Moonest!

00:21:24.650 --> 00:21:26.230
Support them both!

00:21:26.230 --> 00:21:27.980
Hey... Mei!

00:21:27.980 --> 00:21:29.900
Rei!

00:21:28.090 --> 00:21:31.680
Go Rei!

00:21:28.090 --> 00:21:31.680
Go Rei!

00:21:29.900 --> 00:21:31.730
We're rooting for you!

00:21:31.730 --> 00:21:34.100
They're from my job!

00:21:34.100 --> 00:21:37.150
Come on Rei, wave back to them.

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:41.980
Come on, Shizuku. You, too.

00:21:41.980 --> 00:21:44.770
I'll do... my best!

00:21:44.770 --> 00:21:46.650
--Thank you very much!
--Thank you!

00:21:46.650 --> 00:21:48.020
Thank you!

00:21:55.480 --> 00:21:57.690
Right now...

00:21:57.690 --> 00:22:01.560
Their light is still small.

00:22:01.560 --> 00:22:04.940
But Kotono and everyone will surely...

00:22:04.940 --> 00:22:07.400
Thank you very much!

00:22:13.600 --> 00:22:17.100
For a Precious Stage
